{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrum","@type":"LeanModule","name":"FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrum","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":23,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.discrete_vortex_classical_limit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.discrete_vortex_classical_limit","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L137-L143","doc":"**Classical limit** (md item (4)): at `q = 1` the `q`-integer collapses to\nthe ordinary integer `[k]_q → k`, recovering the Kelvin-wave spectrum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.discrete_vortex_ladder_rule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.discrete_vortex_ladder_rule","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L125-L135","doc":"**Ladder selection rule** (md item (3)): for adjacent intensity levels\n(`|j − j'| = 1`, i.e. `n+1 = m` or `m+1 = n`) the transition energy is the\nlevel-energy difference, with the closed form below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.discrete_vortex_transition_energy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.discrete_vortex_transition_energy","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L114-L123","doc":"**Transition energy** `ΔE_{j→j'} = E_{j'} − E_j`, the energy released\nor absorbed in a ladder transition (md formula (3)), obtained by\ndifferencing the level energies. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.discrete_vortex_energy_levels","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.discrete_vortex_energy_levels","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L107-L112","doc":"**Intensity energy levels.** `E_j = ℏ_q/(2 I_q) · [j]_q [j+1]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.discrete_vortex_eigenvalues","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.discrete_vortex_eigenvalues","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L98-L105","doc":"**Eigenvalue spectrum** (md item (1), projection of\n`discrete_vortex_spectrum`). The eigenvalues of the `q`-Laplacian on the\nfilament are `λ_k = [k]_q² · ℏ_q / L_q²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.discrete_vortex_spectrum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.discrete_vortex_spectrum","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L81-L96","doc":"**Discrete vortex mode spectrum** ([`prop:discrete-vortex-spectrum`]).\n\nThe full proposition: (1) the discrete eigenvalue spectrum\n`λ_k = [k]_q² · ℏ_q / L_q²`, (2) the intensity energy levels\n`E_j = ℏ_q/(2 I_q) · [j]_q [j+1]_q`, (3) ladder transitions obeying the\nselection rule `|j − j'| = 1` with energy `ΔE = E_{j'} − E_j`, and\n(4) the classical limit `q → 1`, `[k]_q → k`. All four md bullets are\nbundled here so the `lean.ref` target states the complete proposition,\nnot just the eigenvalue spectrum. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:discrete-vortex-spectrum","label":"prop:discrete-vortex-spectrum","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.classical_limit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.classical_limit","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L79-L79","doc":"**(4) Classical limit.** At `q = 1` the `q`-integer collapses to the\nordinary integer, `[k]_q → k`, recovering the Kelvin-wave / rigid-rotor\nspectrum (`[j]_q[j+1]_q → j(j+1)`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.ladder_transition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.ladder_transition","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L74-L74","doc":"**(3) Ladder transitions, selection rule `|j − j'| = 1`.** For levels\none rung apart (`n+1 = m` or `m+1 = n`) the transition energy is the\nlevel-energy difference `E_{j'} − E_j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.energy_level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.energy_level","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L70-L70","doc":"**(2) Energy levels.** `E_j = ℏ_q/(2 I_q) · [j]_q [j+1]_q`, with the\nlevel energy reading `qInt n * qInt (n+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.spectrum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.spectrum","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L67-L67","doc":"**(1) Eigenvalue spectrum.** `λ_k = [k]_q² · ℏ_q / L_q²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.deltaE","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.deltaE","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L65-L65","doc":"The transition energy `ΔE_{j→j'}` between intensity levels. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.energy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.energy","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L63-L63","doc":"The intensity-level energies, indexed by the spin label `j`\n(here `n` plays the role of `j`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.lam","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.lam","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L60-L60","doc":"The eigenvalues of the `q`-Laplacian on the filament. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.Iq_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.Iq_pos","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.Iq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.Iq","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L57-L57","doc":"`q`-deformed moment of inertia `I_q > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.Lq_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.Lq_pos","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.Lq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.Lq","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L54-L54","doc":"`q`-deformed filament length `L_q > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.hbar_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.hbar_pos","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.hbar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.hbar","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Quantum of action `ℏ_q > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.qInt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.qInt","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The `q`-integer `[k]_q = (qᵏ − q⁻ᵏ)/(q − q⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.q","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The substrate parameter `q : ℝ` (`q > 1` in the spectral regime;\nthe classical limit is `q = 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L44-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.DiscreteVortexSpectrumContext","kind":"class","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/discrete-vortex-spectrum.lean#L41-L79","doc":"Spectral data of a stable vortex filament: the `q`-integer function,\nthe physical scales (`ℏ_q`, filament length `L_q`, moment of inertia\n`I_q`), and the load-bearing spectral formulae the md asserts. ","signatureChunk":0}]}